I'd also like to be clear that your contributions here are of value and respected and that I can learn things from you for sure. If my volume in recent posting here has a negative effect on e.g. perceived pressure, I will back down a bit for you do get more air. Midterm I can maybe help you help the project and do some of the leg-work on a potential path to flipping from mostly opt-out to mostly opt-in (which I think would greatly impact overall project security).

